/bin/
*.exe
.env
kubeconfig
*.log

# Generated security artifacts — regenerate with `make security`.
# (Committing them would go stale silently; CI regenerates on every push.)
security-report.md
sbom.json

# NOTE: vendor/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Committing the vendored dependency
# source makes builds reproducible and lets an auditor read every line of
# third-party code that ends up in the binary — worth the repo size for a tool
# that is pitched on supply-chain posture.
